            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Girdiyi aldıktan sonra onu bir değişkene atayabilir ve diğer tüm değişkenler gibi kullanabilirsin.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;What's your name?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"user_input = input()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hi, \" /><text value=\"{user_input}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"37\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"What's your name?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Mimo\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi, Mimo!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>user_input</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>What's your name?</code> diye sor, yanıtı sakla ve <code>Mimo</code> girdisinin <code>Hi, Mimo!</code> yazdırması için yanıtı kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;What's your name?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"user_input = input()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Hi, \" /><text value=\"{user_input}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name = input()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{name_input}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;user_input&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"What's your name?\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Mimo\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hi, Mimo!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>user_input = input()</code>, ardından <code>{user_input}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
