            "id": 129304,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>10</code> girdisi varsayıldığında çıktı ne olur?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age_string = input(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter your age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (int(age_string) &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Under 21&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;21 or older&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Enter your age: 10\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Under 21\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>21 yaşından küçük</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>21 or older</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>21 yaşından küçük</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Koşulu <code>True</code> olduğunda <code>if</code> bloğu çalışır. Aksi halde <code>else</code> bloğu çalışır.</p><p>Gösterilen çıktı <code>10</code> girdisine ait. Kullanıcı bunun yerine <code>21</code> yazarsa kod hangi son satırı gösterir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"age_string = input(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enter your age: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (int(age_string) &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Under 21&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;21 or older&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Enter your age: 10\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Under 21\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>21 or older</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>21 yaşından küçük</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>21</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>21 or older</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
